36
00:01:26,340 --> 00:01:29,437
I'm done playing, feel it's waiting!

37
00:01:29,520 --> 00:01:31,457
In a world I'm feeling alive!

38
00:01:31,540 --> 00:01:33,257
But I'll be loud!

39
00:01:33,340 --> 00:01:37,040
Wake up, sunshine, here we go!

40
00:01:38,620 --> 00:01:40,500
We have come so far!

41
00:01:41,480 --> 00:01:44,320
Gotta make it to the end!

42
00:01:44,880 --> 00:01:46,337
Whatever danger we find!

43
00:01:46,420 --> 00:01:47,677
No one ever left behind!

44
00:01:47,760 --> 00:01:50,760
I've always got your back, my friend!

45
00:01:52,540 --> 00:01:55,457
Sail on shoreward, keep marching forward!

46
00:01:55,540 --> 00:01:59,117
Dreaming from the very
first day I'd make my name!

47
