And don't you know that
dream hasn't changed!

48
00:02:03,900 --> 00:02:06,317
I'm done playing through with the wave!

49
00:02:06,400 --> 00:02:08,297
In every world I'm feeling alive!

50
00:02:08,380 --> 00:02:09,557
Look out below!

51
00:02:09,640 --> 00:02:12,980
Wake up, sunshine!

52
00:02:14,440 --> 00:02:17,140
Wake up, sunshine!

53
00:02:18,400 --> 00:02:20,157
Wake up, sunshine!

54
