That's much nicer.

91
00:05:15,580 --> 00:05:17,080
But it's not magic.

92
00:05:17,380 --> 00:05:20,380
More like advanced
meteorology, you might say.

93
00:05:23,760 --> 00:05:24,960
Uh-oh.

94
00:05:25,260 --> 00:05:26,613
Squirt cloud prize, go!

95
