Help me, I'm dying! Stay back!

97
00:05:42,280 --> 00:05:45,920
I can't let you touch me,
hee, or I'll be dried squid!

98
00:05:47,720 --> 00:05:48,550
Icarus,

99
00:05:48,633 --> 00:05:51,017
did you notice how
distraught the black-suited

100
00:05:51,100 --> 00:05:53,865
buffoon was when that
woman fell to the ground?

101
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:59,780
I believe we may have discovered
his weakness. Oh, yeah!

102
