you shouldn't be playing with lightning.

107
00:06:14,480 --> 00:06:16,680
Hey, did something just grab me?

108
00:06:22,260 --> 00:06:25,660
Murphy, you can be dried squid instead.

109
00:06:26,240 --> 00:06:27,534
Wait, what's going on?

110
00:06:27,640 --> 00:06:28,470
I can't move.

111
00:06:28,553 --> 00:06:30,320
Somebody help me! Anybody!

112
00:06:34,380 --> 00:06:35,210
Nami?

113
00:06:35,900 --> 00:06:36,730
