When my spear stabs you, you're supposed
to bleed out and turn into dry squid!

122
00:07:18,080 --> 00:07:20,860
a skeleton i'm already dry as a bone

123
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:29,417
But how can that be here jeez
what's the point of having

124
