127
00:07:47,420 --> 00:07:52,340
Franky Franky Come on, you
don't know a super guy like me?

128
00:07:53,200 --> 00:07:55,729
Ah, you're one of their
officers, ain't ya?

129
00:07:56,040 --> 00:07:58,981
