133
00:08:06,400 --> 00:08:07,240
My brother.

134
00:08:07,860 --> 00:08:09,213
You're such a bonehead.

135
00:08:09,540 --> 00:08:10,700
Hey, skeleton.

136
00:08:11,120 --> 00:08:15,240
I'd move away from there if
I were you. Huh? Why's that?

137
