Uh prepare to enter a world of pain?

148
00:08:49,420 --> 00:08:55,397
Yes any moment now he can't
admit he's getting stepped on!

149
00:08:55,480 --> 00:09:00,697
I'm sorry i stepped on
you he said it oh it's

150
00:09:00,780 --> 00:09:02,737
a special technique i
developed for delivering

151
00:09:02,820 --> 00:09:06,597
a headbutt where you
least expect it i call it

152
