Come out, come out, wherever you are.

154
00:09:16,160 --> 00:09:18,900
It's time for some payback. Chomp-chomp!

155
00:09:19,380 --> 00:09:21,417
You're no match for me on the ground.

156
00:09:21,500 --> 00:09:24,880
Now I'm gonna chew you up
and spit you out. Starover!

157
