Heh, I bet I can catch this guy off guard.

164
00:09:49,620 --> 00:09:51,900
Oh boy, almost too easy.

165
00:09:52,680 --> 00:09:55,460
I'll rush you into the ground, Gibson!

166
00:09:56,840 --> 00:09:58,540
Usopp, look out!

167
00:10:01,980 --> 00:10:04,000
