168
00:10:04,780 --> 00:10:06,520
Wow, nice going!

169
00:10:06,860 --> 00:10:08,597
So are all the tunnels connected?

170
00:10:08,680 --> 00:10:10,240
Yep, good to go.

171
00:10:12,220 --> 00:10:13,050
Sweet!

172
00:10:13,133 --> 00:10:15,740
Now, special attack, Green Star!

173
00:10:23,500 --> 00:10:24,760
Wait for it!

174
00:10:24,940 --> 00:10:25,940
Skull Bombgrass!

175
00:10:31,780 --> 00:10:33,700
Too bad for you, Shorty!

176
00:10:34,280 --> 00:10:38,420
We already fought a tunnel digger
back in Alabasta, so we're pros now!

177
00:10:41,040 --> 00:10:43,620
Practice makes perfect,
am I right? Uh-huh.

178
00:10:45,220 --> 00:10:47,840
You trying to make fools out of us?

179
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:50,080
You screwed up my hard work!

180
00:10:50,360 --> 00:10:53,301
