You need help!

194
00:11:53,300 --> 00:11:54,300
Damn it, Heart.

195
00:11:54,460 --> 00:11:56,057
These people weren't even armed.

196
00:11:56,140 --> 00:11:58,434
How the hell could you do this to them?

197
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:02,220
Her Majesty, is she safe now?

198
00:12:03,140 --> 00:12:04,177
I've got no idea.

199
00:12:04,260 --> 00:12:05,460
I wish I did.

200
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:09,159
But wherever she is, I'm
sure she's fighting for us.

201
00:12:09,760 --> 00:12:13,037
Madam Charlie, what's going
to happen to Fishman Island?

202
00:12:13,120 --> 00:12:14,320
Are we going to die?

203
00:12:35,460 --> 00:12:37,300
Fire! Fire!

204
00:12:39,080 --> 00:12:39,910
Ha.

205
00:12:40,380 --> 00:12:41,740
So desperate.

206
00:12:43,080 --> 00:12:46,380
Stay away from the island, Noah! Please!

207
00:12:47,460 --> 00:12:48,660
Shura Hachi!

208
00:12:49,340 --> 00:12:52,040
If the Noah falls now, it's all over!

209
00:12:55,440 --> 00:12:56,270
No!

210
