She came here!

211
00:12:57,520 --> 00:12:58,755
Stop swimming upward!

212
00:12:59,820 --> 00:13:00,650
Sister!

213
00:13:00,733 --> 00:13:03,679
You have to change your
course before it's too late!

214
00:13:04,620 --> 00:13:05,796
They figured it out.

215
