220
00:13:19,380 --> 00:13:20,480
Do not interfere.

221
00:13:21,400 --> 00:13:23,700
Hey! Hey! Hold on!

222
00:13:23,980 --> 00:13:26,800
If Deccan dies, his
ability will stop working.

223
00:13:27,160 --> 00:13:30,160
You see, I stabbed him so
that the Noah would fall.

224
00:13:32,060 --> 00:13:33,500
So that's it!

225
00:13:33,940 --> 00:13:36,060
If she keeps swimming straight up,

226
00:13:36,220 --> 00:13:39,161
the ship's just gonna crash
right into the island!

227
00:13:39,480 --> 00:13:44,800
No matter how far away she swims, the
problem's just going to get worse! After her!

228
00:13:45,100 --> 00:13:47,440
We gotta go tell her what to do! Right!

229
00:13:49,340 --> 00:13:50,420
Shura Hachi!

230
00:13:51,520 --> 00:13:53,100
We need Hachi!

231
00:13:57,480 --> 00:13:58,800
Stop right there.

232
00:13:59,300 --> 00:14:01,040
I won't let you ruin this.

233
00:14:01,200 --> 00:14:02,697
It's far too convenient for me.

234
00:14:02,780 --> 00:14:07,640
Without even raising a finger, I
can crush my enemies in one shot,

235
00:14:07,860 --> 00:14:09,684
