236
00:14:10,100 --> 00:14:11,300
Stay with me.

237
00:14:13,620 --> 00:14:17,060
Shirahoshi, you've got
to swim through the side!

238
00:14:17,900 --> 00:14:18,730
Sister!

239
00:14:34,000 --> 00:14:34,830
She...

240
