Yes?

242
00:14:39,340 --> 00:14:42,040
Useless mermaid, this isn't over.

243
00:14:42,580 --> 00:14:44,577
She's pulling away from the island.

244
00:14:44,660 --> 00:14:45,960
And just in time, too.

245
00:14:46,360 --> 00:14:48,007
You're getting on my nerves.

246
00:14:49,480 --> 00:14:51,300
I'll make you pay for that.

247
00:14:51,640 --> 00:14:53,140
I don't think so!

248
00:14:58,080 --> 00:14:59,140
You brat!

249
00:14:59,460 --> 00:15:01,540
You're not gonna hurt, Weepy Hachi!

250
00:15:02,780 --> 00:15:03,610
Watch me!

251
00:15:07,980 --> 00:15:10,380
Noah, please follow me!

252
00:15:12,080 --> 00:15:13,860
