Yeah, you're doing great.

261
00:15:51,640 --> 00:15:52,797
Almost there.

262
00:15:52,880 --> 00:15:53,710
Keep swimming.

263
00:15:53,793 --> 00:15:54,720
Hurry.

264
00:16:00,240 --> 00:16:02,257
