We were too late!

275
00:16:55,760 --> 00:16:56,640
It's folly!

276
00:17:05,600 --> 00:17:07,360
It's right on target, too.

277
00:17:10,760 --> 00:17:12,340
They're all going to die!

278
00:17:12,680 --> 00:17:14,380
Is there nothing we can do?

279
00:17:15,900 --> 00:17:17,120
