280
00:17:17,340 --> 00:17:19,820
Now this island will bring in a new era!

281
00:17:24,460 --> 00:17:25,860
Yeah!

282
00:18:01,100 --> 00:18:05,737
So he finally gave up the coast
now his ability will lose its

283
