still have to go through me first!

289
00:18:34,560 --> 00:18:35,697
We'll stop you!

290
00:18:35,780 --> 00:18:39,817
If the noah falls it spells
the end for our kingdom!

291
00:18:39,900 --> 00:18:42,977
And the hundreds of years
that were spent protecting

292
