have been all for naught!

293
00:18:46,520 --> 00:18:48,177
Listen well my sons!

294
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:54,440
The ship of promise, Noah, is
much more than some ancient relic.

295
00:18:59,220 --> 00:19:00,120
Centuries ago,

296
