Smart move, but I'm still smarter.

347
00:22:05,820 --> 00:22:08,780
Get in there, I can beat
him with the one hit!

348
00:22:10,220 --> 00:22:12,237
I knew it, he's cutting through.

349
00:22:12,320 --> 00:22:13,200
Oh, no.

350
00:22:13,540 --> 00:22:16,160
So sorry to burst your bubble Straw Hat.

351
00:22:21,400 --> 00:22:22,400
That's no good.

352
00:22:22,640 --> 00:22:25,640
How am I going to beat him
if I can't even breathe?

353
