You humans are nearly so tough
when you're out of your element.

354
00:22:39,220 --> 00:22:42,691
You're even weaker than a fish
out of water, one might say.

355
00:22:43,220 --> 00:22:46,808
If you're no match for me, how
can you hope to stop the Noah?

356
