Fukaboshi asked me to
help you in his stead.

363
00:23:06,660 --> 00:23:07,697
He's gonna fight?

364
00:23:07,780 --> 00:23:11,757
this is sick what did those
people ever do to you what

365
00:23:11,840 --> 00:23:16,437
kind of heartless person values
life so little what are they

366
