397
00:25:15,260 --> 00:25:18,260
What did humans do to you
that was so unforgivable?

398
00:25:19,240 --> 00:25:20,070
Why?

399
00:25:20,153 --> 00:25:22,686
What in this world could
inspire such cruelty?

400
00:25:27,040 --> 00:25:29,417
I don't

401
