it if worse comes to worse.

434
00:27:21,980 --> 00:27:24,060
Take this baby transponder snail.

435
00:27:24,360 --> 00:27:27,657
This will be our last resort in
the event that things go poorly.

436
00:27:27,740 --> 00:27:29,681
We must be prepared for anything.

437
00:27:32,960 --> 00:27:35,440
Oh, Luffy, I don't know what to do.

438
00:27:35,860 --> 00:27:39,507
Hey, guys, what do we need to
do to get a little air from you?

439
00:27:39,700 --> 00:27:42,347
We can shoot out all
the air in the air tank.

440
00:27:42,580 --> 00:27:44,345
What's that thing for, anyway?

441
00:27:45,220 --> 00:27:49,396
