If we create a big bubble and shoot
it, maybe it'll surround the NOAA.

443
00:27:54,720 --> 00:27:55,550
However,

444
00:27:55,633 --> 00:27:57,957
the bubble would neutralize
ascending forces,

445
00:27:58,040 --> 00:28:01,480
