before we could resupply.

450
00:28:10,380 --> 00:28:12,840
What I mean is we've got only one chance.

451
00:28:13,140 --> 00:28:15,337
If we don't manage to
send out the bubble at the

452
00:28:15,420 --> 00:28:18,017
exact moment the NOAA moves
closest to the air tank,

453
