473
00:29:35,820 --> 00:29:37,420
Ready to give up?

474
00:29:38,700 --> 00:29:40,657
You should be human.

475
00:29:40,740 --> 00:29:44,900
Just the sight of you vile worms
makes me sick to my stomach.

476
00:29:45,840 --> 00:29:48,117
Even if it shortens my life,

477
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:51,553
